## Improved .gitignore for this repository
## Covers: Visual Studio / .NET, VS Code, Rider, Node/Angular, logs, secrets, and common temp files

### Visual Studio / .NET
## User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Build outputs
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
out/
publish/
TestResults/

## Rider and ReSharper
.idea/
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

## Visual Studio code workspace
.vs/
.vscode/

## Runtime / compiled
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache

### NuGet
*.nupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
!**/packages/repositories.config

### Dotnet user secrets and local appsettings
## Ignore development/local secrets and environment files (not examples)
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
*.usersecrets

### Databases and local DB files
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.sqlite
*.db

### Node / Angular
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
# Angular build output
frontend/dist/
frontend/out-tsc/
dist/
.angular/

### Env files
.env
.env.*.local
.env.local

### Logs, temp and editor files
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

### Test coverage and reports
coverage/
.nyc_output/
coverage-final.json
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

### CI and tooling
.vspscc
*.vssscc

### Semgrep and local reports (kept in repo currently but ignored if local)
semgrep-custom-report.json
semgrep-full-report.json

### Misc
# Ignore package lock *generated* debug logs but keep lockfiles under source control
# (do not ignore package-lock.json or yarn.lock intentionally)
